{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Toggle off",
  "description": "The same rocker switch thrown off. The latch lands duller, as a short puff of dark air, and with it a damped string-like tone sags a fourth over 70 ms as the light behind the switch dies. Lower, shorter and rounder than Toggle on.",
